From: DevanshSampat <devansh.sampat@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:26:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(arm64): add native Windows ARM64 build targets,
 platforms, and Bazel configurations

Change-Id: If9bc688cc085417eb03fec1e4b94353ee3fd6ee1
---
